---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Why compound. exists, what the name means, and how we work: nodes, bonds and blocks.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap stack-l">
      <span class="label">About</span>
      <h1 class="display-l">Separate elements, bonded into something stronger<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">That’s what a compound is, and it’s how we work. Growing businesses rarely lack talent or ideas. What they lack is someone outside the day-to-day who can see the whole picture, connect the people who hold the answers, and stay long enough to build the change.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid-2 founder">
      <div class="placeholder photo"><strong>Placeholder: founder photo.</strong></div>
      <div class="stack-l">
        <span class="label">The founder</span>
        <h2>Placeholder: your name<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
        <div class="placeholder"><strong>Placeholder: your story.</strong> Your background across commercial, ecommerce, marketing and customer leadership; the kinds of businesses you’ve grown; and the moment you decided to start compound.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap stack-l">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="label">How we work</span>
        <h2>Four things we hold ourselves to<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2 values">
        <div class="panel"><h3>Say the thing.</h3><p>We lead with the finding, not the throat-clearing. If your checkout is losing one order in five, we’ll say so.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><h3>Every number has an owner.</h3><p>Nothing leaves our work without a person, a date and a number to move.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><h3>Bring everyone in.</h3><p>We work with the warehouse lead as much as the CEO. Change happens where the work happens.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><h3>Trust before insight.</h3><p>We check the data before we use it, and tell you how sure we are about every finding.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap grid-2">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="label">Who we work with</span>
        <h2>Mid-market brands ready for their next phase<span class="dot">.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="who-list">
        <li>Founder-led brands scaling beyond the start-up phase</li>
        <li>Established brands moving into, or revamping, direct-to-consumer</li>
        <li>D2C businesses unlocking their next phase of growth</li>
        <li>UK brands expanding into the US and Europe</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand />
</Base>

<style>
  .founder .photo { aspect-ratio: 1; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center; }
  .values .panel { display: grid; gap: var(--s3); }
  .who-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: var(--s4); font-size: 19px; }
  .who-list li { padding-left: 30px; position: relative; }
  .who-list li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 9px; width: 14px; height: 14px; background: var(--block); border: 1.5px solid var(--outline); }
</style>
